//│ deforest > call f⁰@result⁰ @ zipWith¹ -> UnsafeEta
//│ deforest > call id@result³ @ <root> -> UnsafeEta
//│ deforest > call id@result⁴ @ <root> -> UnsafeEta
//│ deforest > call zipWith⁰@result² @ <root> -> UnsafeEta
//│ deforest > call zipWith⁰@result¹ @ zipWith² -> UnsafeEta
//│ deforest > call zipWith⁰@result¹ @ zipWith¹ -> UnsafeEta
